{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "60942b6736720fff06a9f31f2f1f6a2dde0631068cd52b64fdf9d6c15167942f", "ja": "合宿の成果？　はじけるライブへ！", "zh": "集训的成果？迈向活力绽放的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a56de6fbbb87538f99bacebf3b269989eb5ecbe394a48937603dd2c717c79223", "ja": "合宿、最終日。莉緒と真美はやり切った顔で\n満足そう。新曲のヒントを得た雪歩と琴葉も\nやる気十分。聞いた人達を元気にするため、\nアイドル達は心をひとつにするのだった。", "zh": "集训的最后一天。莉绪和真美一脸拼尽全力的表情，\n看起来十分满足。得到新曲灵感的雪步和琴叶也是\n干劲十足。为了让听过的人打起精神，\n偶像们将心连在了一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a4fdd3a84a446ee24146c0b99ea503c39eef420e02473a88683a06be1d096826", "ja": "合宿最終日……", "zh": "集训最后一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2eec0de55c8e4f2ee0df079ecefd6ed1564a79e01b24cb72c7e538bac2af4ece", "ja": "（海辺での合宿は今日で終わり。みんなで、\nビーチカフェのランチに来ているのだが……）", "zh": "（海边的合宿今天就结束了。大家一起来海滩咖啡馆吃午饭，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "e5f769ccd03712fd1d863b4dad0127da63597c7a604636551eb4df39060395c7", "ja": "ふう。楽しかった合宿も最終日ね……。\n私たち、やりきったわよね。どう、真美ちゃん？", "zh": "呼……开心的合宿也到最后一天了呢……\n我们已经尽全力了吧。怎么样，真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "704f2dee45654837362a7652fd8554703f748eb266058e00d60ccc218008d77b", "ja": "真美たちはよくやったよ、りおっち……。\n特訓して、エア失恋して……青春ですなー。", "zh": "真美她们表现得很好哦，莉绪亲……。\n特训，还体验了虚拟失恋……这就是青春啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "413e13cba2acd1ffae3b3a9189e1f323ea0ae9a5c9d8ba01bc906b4a15b6d73d", "ja": "そうね。このひと夏の思い出を胸に、\n明日からも生きていく……いい時間だったわ。", "zh": "是啊。怀揣着这个夏天的回忆，明天起也要继续生活下去……真是段美好的时光呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "73a8c469cd156d2a33a64400d7eee09fd84a98e880401266252aca09af7ca7d9", "ja": "しみじみしてるけど、これで終わりじゃないからな？\nツアー公演でのお披露目は、この後が本番だぞ。", "zh": "虽然现在感慨万千，但这还没结束呢？\n巡演公演上的正式亮相，接下来才是重头戏哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "0ca35212d0c8b414d4bd3f79128e9ef29bba5dd2161c1abc954469a9dfae50ab", "ja": "んもう、わかってるわよ。だからこうして、\n旅の終わりを楽しんでるんじゃない！", "zh": "真是的，我知道啦。所以我这不正在\n好好享受旅程的尾声嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "5f7f82f25cd82fd0838424f3fa175aa3931173d063e2a3820bc5fd25b53f9890", "ja": "そうだよ、兄ちゃん！　真美たちはただ、\n夏のビョーインに浸ってるだけだよ！", "zh": "没错啦，哥哥！真美她们只是在沉浸于夏日的余韵中而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e3f87925e672f224424685bb84e528d2d67ddd3e899d6ffec99307ce57a8e34f", "ja": "それをいうなら、余韻だな。", "zh": "这么说的话，应该是“余韵”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "cfdc199c026b1ef295b6ebe20690a31f7edb3050689b429d9fe2a9a040919fd3", "ja": "私は、合宿に参加できてよかったと思います。\n今回の曲を歌う、ヒントがもらえましたから。", "zh": "我觉得能参加合宿真是太好了。因为我得到了演唱这次歌曲的提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "29afbf1d7cba17de0e896c40ca5113c2a69c364058819bade2369dcb4ff92f85", "ja": "私も、なんだかすっきりしました。\nこれなら、本番もがんばれるかもって。", "zh": "我也觉得，心情莫名地变得轻松了。这样一来，说不定正式演出时也能加油了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b6ec477e930f1fca6934044b2fa630780838708d2dcee716f5cf303cbd2d3185", "ja": "旅行で気持ちを切り替えるって、\nこういうことなんですね！", "zh": "原来通过旅行转换心情，就是这么回事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "9ea5acaccb15ab23970ec4d2eff8bb89830254bca0c752ea62a67fd5145282ff", "ja": "ね、やっぱり特訓して正解だったでしょ♪\n{$P$}くんも、そう思わない？", "zh": "你看，果然特训是正确的选择吧♪\n{$P$}，你也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "74191e369f88853785dab67b3c4a42a947b86a7937c8fc83b8a94837fb6f3f93", "ja": "そうだな。\n最初は、どうなる事かと思ったけど……。", "zh": "是啊。\n一开始，我还真担心会变成什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "464cc65f8cce567d212bfde737f5750c5991e609a2c7ee67f8ce7024b4993d5d", "ja": "ちょっと～、まだ何か文句があるの？　私だって、\nみんなのためにいろいろ考えたんだから～！", "zh": "等等～你还要抱怨什么？我可是也为大家想了很多呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c130def3698152acb6c223a012bac853b2298bf1d77777bda4585d71ba0a2ce3", "ja": "……ふふっ。{$P$}と莉緒さんって、\nなんだか友達みたいですね。", "zh": "……呵呵。{$P$}和莉绪小姐，\n感觉就像朋友一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "38b421b2fdc3304cec1b3472cfcce77e3138dae9222a7bd63f7905587ed76fc8", "ja": "うん、そうかも。アイドルとプロデューサーって\nいうより、気の置けない……同級生みたいな？", "zh": "嗯，也许吧。与其说是偶像和制作人，\n不如说更像是无话不谈的……同学？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a4e8faf73b50388849ed7611ade082cec0d560f41985fbda79de88cf9217c23", "ja": "えっ、そうかな……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "aea9483eb681a4dde1cd27971df28c9fa5fea1e1662e916b6c267dfe5df0c406", "ja": "そ、それは……ほら、みんなと比べると、\n歳が近いからじゃない？", "zh": "那、那个……你看，因为和大家相比，年龄比较接近吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "d92fe3d1e35e17b5fd78b4d264d8bd72752d538c4074b4d6df21e22dfed8b090", "ja": "あれ？　あれあれ？　歳の近い……友達？\nそんな話、どっかで聞いたような……。", "zh": "咦？哎呀呀？年纪相仿的……朋友？\n好像在哪听过这种说法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "3624bc9b05861f9c97607655dd1c7c6fc421eac8398247908bfc874ff7aeed77", "ja": "ほ、ほら！　みんな、早くご飯食べちゃいましょ！\nお土産を選ぶ時間が少なくなっちゃうわよ！", "zh": "那、那个！大家快点把饭吃完吧！\n不然挑选伴手礼的时间就要变少了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "70678f3a8c5f5ed10220200916ae7f6a1fe07da75e6ebf68705dc4f447767f3d", "ja": "この合宿でもらったパワーで、\nレッスンもがんばりましょうね！", "zh": "用这次集训获得的力量，努力练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0198_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_06_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
